The files in this directory are LMA test metadata and optional user-import
manifests. They contain no learned weights, tensors, tokenizer data or images.

Runtime source is the unchanged pinned stable-diffusion.cpp/ggml identified by
third_party/engine-lock.json and third_party/notices/sd-sources.json. The native
Windows host compilation uses research/sd_host without a remote inference path.

SDXL quantization: genai-archive/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0-gguf.
Original architecture/weights: stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0.
The quantizer's CreativeML OpenRAIL-M metadata does not replace the base
model's OpenRAIL++ terms. No redistribution rights or complete license review
are certified here. Users must review each original model card and license.

SD1.5 style adapter: artificialguybr/PixelArtRedmond (bespoke LoRA license).
SDXL style adapter: nerijs/pixel-art-xl (publisher CreativeML OpenRAIL-M).
LCM adapters: latent-consistency/lcm-lora-sdv1-5 and lcm-lora-sdxl
(publisher OpenRAIL++). See assets.json for immutable revisions and links.

Acquisition is an explicit developer action. Tests require already verified
assets and do not download, install or enable models in the Android App.
Host outputs do not certify Android operation, quality, background endurance,
device suitability, all target02/03/05 subtargets, or complete v0.3.0 release.
